            "text": "Granite PM Academy's PDU bundle is on-demand and self-paced only \u2014 there's no live session to schedule or attend. Work through the material whenever it fits your calendar, and earn your PDU certificate of completion as you go."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does it take to complete the PDU renewal bundle?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Since it's entirely self-paced, the timeline is up to you \u2014 most PMP holders complete all 60 PDUs over a few weeks of part-time study, though you can move faster or slower. Plan ahead: renewal PDUs should be earned within your three-year certification cycle, so don't wait until the deadline is close."
