            "text": "Granite PM Academy's full 60-PDU bundle is $125 \u2014 a single, flat price with no live session to schedule. Against the cost of letting a PMP\u00ae credential lapse and having to re-earn it from scratch, or paying PMI's $150 non-member renewal fee on top of a suspended certification, $125 to stay current is a small expense. Many employers also reimburse continuing-education costs; check your benefits policy."
