          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is the PMP certification worth renewing compared to other project management credentials?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The PMP\u00ae is globally recognized by employers across industries and carries significant weight in hiring and promotion decisions. While other credentials like CAPM\u00ae or specialty certifications exist, the PMP\u00ae remains the gold standard for experienced project managers. Renewal through PDU courses keeps your skills current and your credential active\u2014a key differentiator in a competitive job market."
